message: "If you use this code, please cite the article and this repository."
title: "Analysis code for: Routine laboratory data for predicting intensive care unit transfer"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline reproducing every estimate reported in a retrospective prediction
  model study of 30-day intensive care unit transfer based on routine laboratory data,
  including the primary model, temporal validation, the complete 30-day follow-up
  sensitivity analysis and the Kaplan-Meier correction for administrative censoring.
